WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.017
Digital, yes. [laughs]

2
00:00:02.017 --> 00:00:03.663
What about it?

3
00:00:03.663 --> 00:00:07.780
Yes, what happened?

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:11.200
What’s your perspective of what happened there, when the computer thing came on?

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:22.520
To be honest, it’s a combination of something new and just good old-fashioned capitalism.

6
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.340
It caught on because it was a new medium.

7
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.500
It was a new media to work, new medium to work in.

8
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.760
And so people embraced the new because they were curious about it.

9
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:40.260
But it’s gonna not only be embraced, it’s gonna stay put, because it’s basic capitalism, which is that it’s faster.

10
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:40.660
It’s cheaper.

11
00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:45.880
And if you look at anything in history, anything that is faster and cheaper wins.
